node_modules/
dist/
# Bare-name patterns, deliberately: they match in EVERY env dir under
# src/infra (dev, test, and any future one) — never re-scope them to one dir.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
tfplan
*.tfvars
# Which env the make targets address (make profile dev|test, D57) — operator-
# local by nature, and committing it would silently pick an env for everyone.
.tf-profile
# An editor swap file of ente-sl.tfvars holds hashing_key in cleartext, and
# `*.tfvars` above does NOT match `.ente-sl.tfvars.swp`. D4a says that key must
# never reach git; this is the hole it would slip through.
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Second-pass security findings (2026-08-18). Gitignored deliberately: it
# details a CONFIRMED, UNFIXED account-takeover exploit (exact payloads). Do
# not commit a working exploit recipe to history — move it into tracking (as
# SECURITY-REVIEW.md is) only after the F1 critical is fixed and re-verified.
SECURITY-REVIEW-2.md
